Hi Jyoty,

The error message says:

./ACOTSP-1.03/acotsp: not found or not executable (pwd: /home/jyoti/tuning/acotsp-arena)

which means that the 'acotsp' executable is not available. You need to go into ACOTSP-1.03 and execute:

make

to compile the ACOTSP code. Please make sure that there are no errors when doing `make` and that it creates a file `acotsp`.

Cheers,

Manuel.

